Subject: [PATCH 5/5] egis0575: Fix opening the sensor again after a session

After a previous session the sensor never reported ready while reading
the calibration, so opening it looped forever. Reset the sensor before
reading the calibration, give up polling after a while, and release the
USB interface again if opening fails. Also check that claiming the
interface worked.

